#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:421
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_ComeAndGetSome"
msgid ""
"What, are you coming?\n"
"Come and get some, then!$"
msgstr ""
"怎么，你要过来吗？\n"
"那就放马过来吧！$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:425
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_Peeko"
msgid "PEEKO: Pii pihyoh!$"
msgstr "皮可：哔哔哟！$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:428
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_GruntIntro"
msgid ""
"Grah, keelhaul it all!\p"
"That hostage POKéMON turned out to\n"
"be worthless!\p"
"And to think I made a getaway…\n"
"In this tunnel to nowhere!\p"
"Hey! You!\n"
"So you want to battle me?$"
msgstr ""
"呃啊，全都见鬼去吧！\p"
"那只抓来当人质的宝可梦\n"
"根本一点用都没有！\p"
"亏我还逃跑了……\n"
"结果逃进了这条死路隧道！\p"
"喂！你！\n"
"你想跟我对战吗？$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:437
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_GruntDefeat"
msgid ""
"Urrrggh! My career in crime comes to\n"
"a dead end!$"
msgstr ""
"呜啊啊啊！\n"
"我的犯罪生涯走到尽头了！$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:441
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_GruntTakePackage"
msgid ""
"This is plain not right…\p"
"The BOSS told me this would be a\n"
"slick-and-easy job to pull.\p"
"All I had to do was steal some package\n"
"from DEVON.\p"
"Tch!\n"
"You want it back that badly, take it!$"
msgstr ""
"这也太不对劲了……\p"
"老大跟我说，\n"
"这是个轻轻松松就能搞定的活儿。\p"
"我只要从得文公司\n"
"偷个包裹就行了。\p"
"啧！\n"
"你这么想要的话，就拿去吧！$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:450
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_PeekoGladToSeeYouSafe"
msgid ""
"PEEKO!\n"
"Am I glad to see you're safe!$"
msgstr ""
"皮可！\n"
"看到你平安无事，真是太好了！$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:454
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_ThankYouLetsGoHomePeeko"
msgid ""
"PEEKO owes her life to you!\p"
"They call me MR. BRINEY.\n"
"And, you are?\p"
"… … … … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"Ah, so you are {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"I sincerely thank you!\p"
"Now, if there's anything that troubles\n"
"you, don't hesitate to tell me!\p"
"You can usually find me in my cottage\n"
"by the sea near PETALBURG WOODS.\p"
"Come, PEEKO, we should make our way\n"
"home.\p"
"PEEKO: Pihyoh!$"
msgstr ""
"皮可的命是你救的！\p"
"大家都叫我哈奇老人。\n"
"那么，你是？\p"
"…… …… …… ……\n"
"…… …… …… ……\p"
"啊，原来你叫{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"真是太感谢你了！\p"
"以后要是有什么烦恼，\n"
"尽管来告诉我！\p"
"我一般都待在\n"
"橙华森林附近的海边小屋里。\p"
"来，皮可，\n"
"我们该回家了。\p"
"皮可：哔哟！$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:470
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_WhyCantTheyKeepDigging"
msgid ""
"… …\p"
"Why can't they keep digging?\n"
"Is the bedrock too hard?\p"
"My beloved awaits me in VERDANTURF\n"
"TOWN just beyond here…\p"
"If RUSTBORO and VERDANTURF were\n"
"joined by this tunnel, I could visit\l"
"her every day…\p"
"But this…\n"
"What am I to do?$"
msgstr ""
"…… ……\p"
"为什么不能继续挖下去了呢？\n"
"是因为岩层太硬了吗？\p"
"我心爱的人就在\n"
"隧道另一头的绿荫镇等着我……\p"
"要是卡那兹市和绿荫镇\n"
"能用这条隧道连起来，\l"
"我就能每天去见她了……\p"
"可是现在这样……\n"
"我该怎么办才好？$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:482
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_ToGetToVerdanturf"
msgid ""
"To get from RUSTBORO to VERDANTURF,\n"
"you need to go to DEWFORD, then pass\l"
"through SLATEPORT and MAUVILLE…$"
msgstr ""
"从卡那兹市去绿荫镇，\n"
"得先去武斗镇，\l"
"然后再经过凯那市和紫堇市……$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:487
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_YouShatteredBoulderTakeHM"
msgid ""
"Wow! You shattered that boulder\n"
"blocking the way.\p"
"To show you how much I appreciate it,\n"
"I'd like you to have this HM.$"
msgstr ""
"哇！你把挡路的大岩石\n"
"打碎了。\p"
"为了表示我的感谢，\n"
"这个秘传学习器送给你。$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:493
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_ExplainStrength"
msgid ""
"That HM contains STRENGTH.\p"
"If a muscular POKéMON were to learn\n"
"that, it would be able to move even\l"
"large boulders.$"
msgstr ""
"这个秘传学习器里是怪力。\p"
"如果让力气大的宝可梦学会它，\n"
"就连巨大的岩石也能推动。$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:499
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_WandaReunion"
msgid ""
"WANDA!\n"
"Now I can see you anytime!\p"
"WANDA: That's…wonderful.\p"
"Please, take some rest at my home.$"
msgstr ""
"婉达！\n"
"这样我随时都能见到你了！\p"
"婉达：那真是……太好了。\p"
"请到我家里休息一下吧。$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:505
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_BoyfriendOnOtherSideOfRock"
msgid ""
"On the other side of this rock…\n"
"My boyfriend is there.\p"
"He… He's not just digging the tunnel\n"
"to come see me.\p"
"He works his hands raw and rough\n"
"for the benefit of everyone.$"
msgstr ""
"在这块岩石的另一边……\n"
"是我的男朋友。\p"
"他……他挖这条隧道\n"
"不只是为了来见我。\p"
"他是为了大家，\n"
"才把双手都磨得又红又粗糙。$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:513
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_MikeIntro"
msgid ""
"What do you call a wild man up in the\n"
"mountains? A mountain man, right?\p"
"So why don't they call a POKéMON in\n"
"the mountains a mountain POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""
"住在山里的野人叫“山野之人”，\n"
"对吧？\p"
"那为什么住在山里的宝可梦\n"
"不叫“山野宝可梦”呢？$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:519
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_MikeDefeat"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON…\n"
"Ran out of power…$"
msgstr ""
"我的宝可梦……\n"
"没力气了……$"

#: data/maps/RusturfTunnel/scripts.inc:523
msgctxt "RusturfTunnel_Text_MikePostBattle"
msgid ""
"They halted development here to\n"
"protect POKéMON, right?\l"
"There's a feel-good story!$"
msgstr ""
"为了保护宝可梦，\n"
"这里的开发工程停止了，对吧？\l"
"真是个暖心的故事！$"
